Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.00,Serifa Std,,0,0,410,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:03.23,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,The stone... shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:18.44,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs24.2}Are you done yet, Fullmetal? We can't keep this up much longer!
