Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:29.12,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,This has to be Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:31.89,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,I see. You did it, Fullmetal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:51.91,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}That transmutation circle on the pedestal was the last remnant of your human heart.
